  "details": "My avatar keeps constantly changing without any input from me, and it is becoming incredibly disruptive. I can hear the distinct sound notification for an avatar swap right now because VRChat is currently open in the background. It keeps cycling my avatar back and forth between different models, and honestly, the lack of control is getting infuriating.\n\nThis isn’t just a one-time glitch; it keeps happening repeatedly. I’ve heard the change sound trigger at least 10 times in this session alone, and the frequency seems to increase the longer I stay in the game. It’s making it impossible to enjoy the experience or interact with others normally.\n\nI’ve tried looking through my settings, but nothing seems to stop the constant switching. I really need some technical help or advice on how to fix this, please. Does anyone know if this is a known bug, a hardware ghost-input issue, or perhaps something wrong with my account sync? Or if VRChat can make an update to fix this.",
